{"id":"general","lemma":"general","pos":"adj","rank":451,"glosses":["general, overall"],"ipa":"/xeneˈɾal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"generales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-general.wav","formAudio":{"generales":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/33/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-generales.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Qué bebe usted por lo general, vino o cerveza?","en":"Which do you usually drink, wine or beer?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/522083","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"baby"},{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"it / him"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"beer"}]},{"text":"Por lo general me voy a dormir muy temprano.","en":"I usually go to sleep very early.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/730423","words":[{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"it / him"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to sleep"},null,{"g":"early, early on"}]},{"text":"Por lo general llegan a casa más tarde que nosotros.","en":"They usually get home later than us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/937706","words":[{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"it / him"},null,{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},null,null,null,null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"we"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"home"],[6,8,"later"]]},{"text":"En general me acuesto a las diez.","en":"I usually go to bed at ten.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639796","words":[{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to lay","l":"acostar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"A"}]},{"text":"En general ha sido un buen viaje.","en":"It's been a nice trip overall.","words":[{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"bon voyage!"]]}]}